msgid "Index"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/architecture/vector_index.md 77d4c027f930400fa37e07162d78d3ec
msgid ""
"Dingo's index is equivalent to a key-value storage, specifically for vector-"
"type indexes. For vector indexes, it stores the complete vector, vector "
"UUID, and vector metadata. It utilizes third-party libraries like Faiss to "
"generate vector indexes."
msgstr ""
"Dingo 的索引相当于键值存储，特别适用于向量类型的索引。对于向量索引，它会存储"
"完整的向量、向量 UUID 和向量元数据。它利用 Faiss 等第三方库生成向量索引。"

#: ../../source/architecture/vector_index.md:10
#: 201cfadcce2a4b60bc7a0c633abb5912
msgid "Architecture Design"
msgstr "架构设计"

#: ../../source/architecture/vector_index.md:11
#: ad90eb4cec334a67a1f84611da3543fb
msgid ""
"The overall component diagram of the new DingoDB after adding Dingo-Index: !"
"[Index Architecture.png](../../images/index-architecture.png) In the overall "
"semantics of DingoDB, a new Index concept is added at the same level as "
"Table, and the Coordinator is correspondingly enhanced with Index management "
"and gRPC interface."
msgstr ""
"添加 Dingo-Index 后的新 DingoDB 整体组件图： ![Index Architecture.png](../../"
"images/index-architecture.png) 在DingoDB的整体语义中，新增了与Table同级的"
"Index概念，Coordinator也相应地增强了Index管理和gRPC接口。"

#: ../../source/architecture/vector_index.md:11
#: 431877ea726c4cc2992eddc85ae5c954
msgid "Index Architecture.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/architecture/vector_index.md:15
#: 94bfd73d76b645b49d8965d20a909ca0
msgid ""
"In the first iteration, only VectorIndex is temporarily considered to be "
"supported. Scalar Index will be supported in the subsequent iterations."
msgstr "在第一次迭代中，暂时只支持 VectorIndex。随后的迭代将支持标量索引。"

#: ../../source/architecture/vector_index.md:17
#: bef0ca15c22c47288b163fe415783b1f
msgid ""
"Support for simultaneous creation of Index is added when creating a table "
"using CreateTable."
msgstr "使用 CreateTable 创建表格时，增加了对同时创建索引的支持。"

#: ../../source/architecture/vector_index.md:19
#: 9c1b30ab14934f34815f9b18576ed2d7
msgid ""
"Support for CreateIndex is added, allowing users to use Index directly as a "
"Collection concept in general Vector Databases, just like using purely "
"Vector Databases such as Milvus and Chroma."
msgstr ""
"新增了对 CreateIndex 的支持，允许用户在一般向量数据库中直接使用 Index 作为集"
"合概念，就像使用 Milvus 和 Chroma 等纯向量数据库一样。"

#: ../../source/architecture/vector_index.md:21
#: c39ab877f6e44b96a4fc2f85fc2a569e
msgid ""
"This design enables DingoDB to implement SQL on Vector like pgvector and "
"clickhouse, while also using Vector as a First Class Citizen like Milvus."
msgstr ""
"通过这种设计，DingoDB 可以像 pgvector 和 clickhouse 一样在 Vector 上实现 "
"SQL，同时也可以像 Milvus 一样将向量作为一等公民使用。"

#: ../../source/architecture/vector_index.md:23
#: 60a8ab5045c640f1a95f9f635d618311
msgid ""
"DW Proxy is a component used to implement double-write of Table+Index whose "
"independent existence remains to be determined."
msgstr ""
"DW Proxy 是一个用于实现 Table+Index 双写法的组件，其独立存在性尚待确定。"

#: ../../source/architecture/vector_index.md:25
#: b76180d70a734ed4b20262b1edbb9aa5
msgid "New I/O Workflow"
msgstr "新的输入/输出工作流程"

#: ../../source/architecture/vector_index.md:27
#: c2f5a9c175df4587a9bb75abcf629ac6
msgid "Table Creation Process"
msgstr "表格创建过程"

#: ../../source/architecture/vector_index.md:29
#: 85b3cd066a4b414eb3dff311bf11aa29
msgid ""
"The CreateTable process without an index is the same as in version 0.6.0. "
"The CreateTable process with an index is as follows:"
msgstr ""
"不带索引的 CreateTable 进程与 0.6.0 版相同。带索引的 CreateTable 进程如下："

#: ../../source/architecture/vector_index.md:31
#: d0046cbf073c41d4bb5994d62fed17c9
msgid ""
"In simple terms, the Coordinator drives the creation of Regions for both "
"Store and Index components. ![CreateTable.png](../../images/index-"
"createTable.png)"
msgstr ""
"简单地说，Coordinator 为存储和索引组件创建 Region。![CreateTable.png](../../"
"images/index-createTable.png)"

#: ../../source/architecture/vector_index.md:31
#: a6a297f041aa497b90a39587d5c5c573
msgid "CreateTable.png"
