#: ../../source/architecture/vector_index.md:34
#: 516d0f5202654f7cbc1efaba2f9e4881
msgid "**The specific process is as follows:**"
msgstr "**具体流程如下：**"

#: ../../source/architecture/vector_index.md:36
#: 9252cbef892e48629d1df1d777ef49ec
msgid ""
"Due to the current design limitations of DingoDB, if a user wants to use a "
"Table with an Index, the user must declare the index at the time of creating "
"the table."
msgstr ""
"由于 DingoDB 目前的设计限制，如果用户想使用带有索引的表，就必须在创建表时声明"
"索引。"

#: ../../source/architecture/vector_index.md:38
#: adf7285496e74dc5ad58830f7ca5a6c1
msgid ""
"The user executes an SQL statement through an SQL client, similar to the "
"following statement (the specific format of the SQL statement needs to be "
"designed later, and the following statement is only for illustration "
"purposes):"
msgstr ""
"用户通过 SQL 客户端执行 SQL 语句，类似于以下语句（SQL 语句的具体格式需要稍后"
"设计，以下语句仅供参考）："

#: ../../source/architecture/vector_index.md:48
#: 80ae5253984f4033887243bf0a807d99
msgid ""
"In the SQL statement above, the user creates a table with three fields, "
"where the 'embedding' field is a 1024-dimensional vector. At the same time, "
"the user declares the creation of two indexes - one vector index based on "
"the 'embedding' field, using the Ivfflat index type, Euclidean distance, and "
"1024 nlists; and the other is a scalar index based on the 'name' field, "
"using the LSM index type."
msgstr ""
"在上面的 SQL 语句中，用户创建了一个包含三个字段的表，其中 “embedding ”字段是"
"一个 1024 维向量。同时，用户声明创建两个索引：一个是基于 “embedding ”字段的向"
"量索引，使用 Ivfflat 索引类型、欧氏距离和 1024 nlists；另一个是基于 “name ”字"
"段的标量索引，使用 LSM 索引类型。"

#: ../../source/architecture/vector_index.md:50
#: 1cfb5b0e9bf24e8082ef1e52989dafab
msgid ""
"The Executor generates a gRPC message to call the CreateTable interface of "
"the Coordinator according to the create table statement passed in by the "
"user. Since the user requests to create an index, in addition to the "
"TableDefinition, an IndexDefinition also needs to be generated. For the "
"example above, two IndexDefinitions need to be generated."
msgstr ""
"Executor 根据用户传入的创建表语句生成 gRPC 消息，调用Coordinator 的 "
"CreateTable 接口。由于用户要求创建一个索引，因此除了 TableDefinition 之外，还"
"需要生成一个 IndexDefinition。在上面的示例中，需要生成两个 IndexDefinition。"

#: ../../source/architecture/vector_index.md:52
#: 0b69c05ecfc84a3a9652763048d4948a
msgid ""
"After receiving the gRPC request for CreateTable, the Coordinator parses the "
"TableDefinition and IndexDefinition and calls the Store and Index nodes "
"respectively to perform the CreateRegion and CreateIndexRegion operations."
msgstr ""
"接收到 CreateTable 的 gRPC 请求后，Coordinator 会解析 TableDefinition 和 "
"IndexDefinition，并分别调用存储节点和索引节点来执行 CreateRegion 和 "
"CreateIndexRegion 操作。"

#: ../../source/architecture/vector_index.md:54
#: b54c253ad25748e1b70fef262806ae79
msgid ""
"The Store follows the same CreateRegion process as in version 0.6.0, while "
"the Index completes the CreateIndexRegion process as shown in the figure "
"above."
msgstr ""
"存储区遵循与 0.6.0 版相同的 CreateRegion 流程，而索引则完成 "
"CreateIndexRegion 流程，如上图所示。"

#: ../../source/architecture/vector_index.md:56
#: 4ef45e2fd5be446ab80b04a4bad28e79
msgid "Data Read and Write Process (SQL on Vector)"
msgstr "数据读写过程（向量检索 SQL）"

#: ../../source/architecture/vector_index.md:58
#: 51ed2b8cfa9b4cae8245d011dd77f2e7
msgid ""
"The read and write process for tables without indexes is completely the same "
"as in version 0.6.0."
msgstr "无索引表的读写过程与 0.6.0 版完全相同。"

#: ../../source/architecture/vector_index.md:60
#: 1a4d8c2d513a4d679e69f22e1dd283db
msgid ""
"For tables with indexes, the Executor needs to handle the issue of dual "
"write. When querying data, the Executor generates an execution plan based on "
"the definition of the Table to determine if an index query is needed. If an "
"index query is required, the Executor initiates a query to the Index "
"component. ![Sql on vector.png](../../images/index-rw-sql-on-vector.png)"
msgstr ""
"对于有索引的表，Executor 需要处理双重写入问题。在查询数据时，Executor 会根据"
"表的定义生成一个执行计划，以确定是否需要进行索引查询。如果需要索引查询，"
"Executor 就会向索引组件发起查询。![Sql on vector.png](../../images/index-rw-"
"sql-on-vector.png)"

#: ../../source/architecture/vector_index.md:60
#: 54ef8d2a5c52478eb44cbc67b13ee034
msgid "Sql on vector.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/architecture/vector_index.md:63
#: d93f6d83364846b0bc8285eb51b21194
msgid "Data Read and Write Process (Vector only)"
msgstr "数据读写过程（仅向量）"

#: ../../source/architecture/vector_index.md:65
#: 0040115cf2af492fb79d8837254101ce
msgid ""
"For scenarios that solely involve langchain, the SQL component is not "
"necessary. Therefore, if users only require the capabilities of Vector, they "
"can directly use Index."
msgstr ""
"对于只涉及链的情况，则不需要 SQL 组件。因此，如果用户只需要向量的功能，可以直"
"接使用索引。"

#: ../../source/architecture/vector_index.md:67
#: e9463a5577c84b3994bbc661deb1193d
msgid ""
"The diagram below illustrates that the SDK client can directly use Index-"
"Vector storage by utilizing the CreateIndex function. During the read and "
"write process, data manipulation is performed using Index-specific "
"interfaces such as Get and Put."
msgstr ""
"下图说明，SDK 客户端可以利用 CreateIndex 函数直接使用索引向量存储。在读写过程"
"中，数据操作使用特定于索引的接口（如 Get 和 Put）进行。"

#: ../../source/architecture/vector_index.md:69
#: dcb1a41844634248a68e9a9c1734b707
msgid ""
"In this case, we can refer to the various APIs implemented by major Vector "
"Databases to meet the requirements of various Vector Search operations. !"
"[Vector only.png](../../images/index-rw-vector-only.png)"
msgstr ""
"在这种情况下，我们可以参考主要向量数据库实现的各种 API，以满足各种向量搜索操"
"作的要求。![Vector only.png](../../images/index-rw-vector-only.png)"

